      en: ["The highest peak in the range exceeds 2,400 meters in elevation.", "Cal Madow is home to rare species like the Warsangli Linnet bird.", "The name 'Cal Madow' literally means 'Black Mountains' in Somali.", "The area is the global leader in the production of Maydi-grade frankincense.", "Mist forests capture essential moisture from the Gulf of Aden winds.", "Botanists have identified plant lineages here dating back to the Jurassic period."],
      es: ["Longitud: 450 km", "Pico más alto: Shimbiris (2416 m)", "Roca: piedra caliza", "Especie endémica: asno salvaje somalí", "Precipitación anual: hasta 800 mm", "Importante cuenca hidrográfica"],
      pt: ["Comprimento: 450 km", "Pico mais alto: Shimbiris (2416 m)", "Rocha: calcário", "Espécie endémica: burro selvagem somali", "Precipitação anual: até 800 mm", "Importante bacia hidrográfica"],
      fr: ["Longueur : 450 km", "Sommet le plus haut : Shimbiris (2 416 m)", "Roche : calcaire", "Espèce endémique : âne sauvage de Somalie", "Précipitations annuelles : jusqu'à 800 mm", "Bassin hydrographique important"],
