      en: ["The Bajuni Islands consist of 6 main islands and several smaller islets.", "Kismayo is located roughly 528 km (328 miles) southwest of Mogadishu.", "The Juba River, Somalia's largest, enters the sea just north of the city.", "The region is a major exporter of high-value spiny lobsters.", "Coral reefs provide essential coastal protection from Indian Ocean storms.", "Historically, Kismayo was an important hub in the Sultanate of Zanzibar."],
